1
00:00:05,212 --> 00:00:06,532
早上好 阳光少女
Good morning, sunshine.

2
00:00:06,532 --> 00:00:07,733
昨晚在院子里睡得怎么样
How was your night in the yard?

3
00:00:07,912 --> 00:00:10,042
完美 我就喜欢睡在外面
Perfect. I like sleeping outside.

4
00:00:12,012 --> 00:00:13,173
海莉又弄丢了钥匙
Haley lost her keys again.

5
00:00:13,242 --> 00:00:15,421
她在经历不负责任的阶段
She's been going through this irresponsible phase.

6
00:00:15,591 --> 00:00:17,011
是啊 长达25年了
Yeah, for 25 years.

7
00:00:17,011 --> 00:00:18,452
我不会让她持续到26年
I'm not gonna let her get to 26.

8
00:00:18,641 --> 00:00:22,411
我要说明一点 克莱尔不会杀了她
Just to be clear, Claire's not going to kill her.

9
00:00:24,001 --> 00:00:26,241
让我进去 拜托
Let me in! Please!

10
00:00:26,261 --> 00:00:27,262
-不 -拜托
- No. - Please?

11
00:00:27,281 --> 00:00:29,750
就像她小时候我们对她用费伯入眠法一样
This is just like when we Ferberized her as a baby.

12
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:31,720
让她哭够了就会安静下来
Let her cry it out. She'll settle down.

13
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:33,500
为什么啊
Why?!

14
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,581
我扔一条毛毯出去怎么样
What if I just throw a blanket out there?

15
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:37,410
有我们味道的东西
Something that smells like us.

16
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:40,750
你们怎么能留我在外面 现在是凌晨两点啊
You can't leave me out here! It's 2:00 in the morning!

17
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:43,110
我得换衣服参加派对啊
I have to change for a party.

18
00:00:43,559 --> 00:00:44,580
晚安 亲爱的
Good night, honey.

19
00:01:00,138 --> 00:01:01,948
-早上好 菲尔 -不要
- Morning, Phil. - No!

20
00:01:01,948 --> 00:01:03,018
今天不...
It's not a --

21
00:01:03,018 --> 00:01:03,789
不是什么好早晨
It's not a good morning.

22
00:01:04,198 --> 00:01:05,279
而且今天接下来还会更糟糕
It's gonna be an even worse day.

23
00:01:05,628 --> 00:01:08,218
每天早上我洗澡之前 都会踢起内裤
Every morning, before I shower, I kick off my underwear.

24
00:01:08,738 --> 00:01:10,408
如果我接到了 今天就会很棒
If I catch it, it's gonna be a great day.

25
00:01:10,698 --> 00:01:11,339
如果没有
If I don't...

26
00:01:12,188 --> 00:01:13,197
不
No!

27
00:01:13,197 --> 00:01:13,739
那就是灾难
...disaster.

28
00:01:13,827 --> 00:01:15,007
我知道这听起来很神经病
I know that sounds crazy,

29
00:01:15,007 --> 00:01:16,177
但这是我家族流传的传统
but it's an old family ritual

30
00:01:16,177 --> 00:01:18,467
我祖父一直这样做 直到他去世那天
my grandfather did until the day he died --

31
00:01:18,617 --> 00:01:21,187
那天... 你猜到了
a day -- you guessed it --

32
00:01:21,187 --> 00:01:22,797
那天他没接到内裤
that he dropped his underwear.

33
00:01:22,907 --> 00:01:23,708
我也不知道怎么回事
I don't know what happened.

34
00:01:24,177 --> 00:01:25,157
那一踢力道强劲
It was a strong kick,

35
00:01:25,157 --> 00:01:26,298
脚踝的摆动恰到好处
ankle flick was on point.

36
00:01:26,397 --> 00:01:28,466
这只是个荒唐的迷信
It is just a ridiculous superstition.

37
00:01:28,526 --> 00:01:29,567
荒唐吗 我们来回顾往事
Ridiculous? Let's review.

38
00:01:29,916 --> 00:01:31,506
我滑旱冰撞上蜜蜂的那天
The day I Rollerbladed into bees --

39
00:01:31,726 --> 00:01:32,617
我没接到内裤
I dropped my underwear.

40
00:01:32,956 --> 00:01:34,906
我滑旱冰撞上营火的那晚
The night I Rollerbladed into that campfire --

41
00:01:35,036 --> 00:01:36,127
不如你别滑旱冰吧
How about you stop Rollerblading?

42
00:01:36,156 --> 00:01:37,497
不如我别呼吸了
How about I stop breathing?

43
00:01:38,756 --> 00:01:40,206
我没接到内裤的日子 最好的选择就是
When I miss my catch, the best thing I can do

44
00:01:40,226 --> 00:01:41,626
在安全的地方等待今天过去
is just wait it out in a safe place.

45
00:01:42,035 --> 00:01:42,986
今天不行 不不不
Unh-unh. Not today. No, no, no.

46
00:01:43,025 --> 00:01:44,256
我们有一大堆家事得处理
We have a ton of errands to get done

47
00:01:44,315 --> 00:01:45,985
然后下午要去看斯迪利·丹乐队
before we go see Steely Dan this afternoon.

48
00:01:45,985 --> 00:01:47,345
-那是几点 -下午三点
- What time is that? - ?3:00 P.M.

49
00:01:47,345 --> 00:01:49,615
-为什么这么早... -他们不年轻了 菲尔
- Why is it so -- - They are not young men, Phil.

50
00:01:50,355 --> 00:01:52,485
真棒 我手机坏了 这全怪你们
Great. My phone is broken, and it's your fault.

51
00:01:52,555 --> 00:01:53,576
这黑锅从何而来
How do you figure that?

52
00:01:53,725 --> 00:01:55,495
因为我昨晚得朝松鼠扔手机
Because I had to throw it at some squirrels last night

53
00:01:55,525 --> 00:01:56,894
来阻止它们攻击我
to keep them from attacking me.

54
00:01:56,934 --> 00:01:58,215
你们得给我买台新手机
You guys have to buy me a new one.

55
00:01:58,404 --> 00:01:59,905
