没有 你没破到财
No, it's not costing you money

57
00:02:00,944 --> 00:02:02,634
因为我们才不给她买新手机
because we are not buying her a new phone.

58
00:02:02,714 --> 00:02:03,224
什么
What?!

59
00:02:03,224 --> 00:02:04,704
但我工作时要用手机
But I need it for work.

60
