and it drives me crazy.

97
00:03:18,319 --> 00:03:21,429
还记得我们的印第安纳州罗马市之旅吗
Remember that romantic trip we took to Rome, Indiana?

98
00:03:21,519 --> 00:03:22,410
我本来就是计划去那里啊
That's where I wanted to go.

99
00:03:22,739 --> 00:03:24,088
我没买错机票好吗
I meant to buy those tickets.

100
00:03:24,088 --> 00:03:25,408
那你为什么学意大利语
Then why did you learn Italian?

101
00:03:25,408 --> 00:03:26,778
妈妈咪呀 杰
Mamma mia, Jay.

102
00:03:26,778 --> 00:03:28,019
如果我真出了车祸
If I had been in an accident,

103
00:03:28,088 --> 00:03:29,518
我会承认的
I will admit it.

104
00:03:29,678 --> 00:03:33,298
现在我要去网上买更多拖鞋了
Now, I have to go and buy more slippers online.

105
00:03:33,398 --> 00:03:35,768
尽量别让电脑崩溃[撞]了
Try not to crash the computer.

106
00:03:35,768 --> 00:03:39,217
小卡 健身房的毛巾小妹
Hey, Cam. So, the towel girl at the gym

