我会对你做什么
...things I'd do to you.

116
00:03:57,046 --> 00:03:59,046
我知道你只有10分钟
I know you only got 10 minutes...

117
00:03:59,046 --> 00:04:01,666
10分钟 他还有时间限制吗
10 minutes? He's on a time limit?

118
00:04:01,666 --> 00:04:03,366
她在跟监狱里的博说话
She's talking to Bo in jail.

119
00:04:03,366 --> 00:04:04,646
博是小帕孩子的爸爸
Bo is Pam's baby daddy --

120
00:04:04,646 --> 00:04:06,846
目前被关在密苏里州的格拉斯霍普
currently incarcerated back in Grasshopper, Missouri,

121
